Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
At Advisority, we help our clients make their work flow - and achieve more with AI. 
 We combine business understanding with IT capabilities to help our clients focus on what matters most. From our headquarters in London to our teams across Romania, we deliver projects and services across industries including banking, insurance, payments, utilities and pharma.
 We are looking for a Java Developer to join us and contribute to the development and maintenance of banking applications.
 Your role within Advisority 
Develop and maintain Java-based applications for high-volume, low-latency and highly available banking systems;
Understand and challenge business requirements and contribute to detailed software design;
Participate in Agile ceremonies and the development, testing, user acceptance and production release phases;
Build and integrate RESTful services and contribute to secure, reliable application architecture;
Work with the team to improve development practices, quality and delivery processes.
 What sets you apart 
Over 3 years of software development experience with 2+ years of extensive experience on Java platform;
Hands-on experience in back-end development using Java and Spring Framework;
Strong experience in developing and integrating RESTful web services using Spring, including web services security;
Experience with messaging systems such as Kafka, RabbitMQ or similar. 
 How we work 
 We believe in Trust, Fairness, Agility, Inclusivity and Resilience — values that shape how we work with our people, our clients and each other.
